Package: frazil
Title: Antarctic Sea Ice Figures from the NSIDC Sea Ice Index
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Wethington", , "michael.wethington@briloon.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads the NSIDC Sea Ice Index, Version 4 (data set G02135)
    for the Southern Hemisphere, computes daily and monthly extent statistics
    with a record rule that allows for the 2025 change to the AMSR2 sensor,
    builds an Imhof-style terrain from REMA elevation and the SCAR Antarctic
    Digital Database, and renders slide figures and an animation of sea ice
    concentration and extent for any date and any polar map window.
